  "acceptance": [
    "The store holds the approved model-A records: immutable SharedImportVersion per changed task retaining shared baseline/origin; immutable ImportReceipt bound to operation key, candidate fingerprint, binding, base, resolved commit/tree, readset and result; immutable candidate-bound ReconciliationHold; audited WorkTransition with non-success SupersededByImport retirement that never creates a CompletionSeal; durable imported-baseline heads and holds",
